---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout path="">
  <h1>Joe Neiman</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    I'm an average guy who has been able to achieve some pretty incredible outcomes
    through a combination of thinking big, trusting my gut, learning from failures
    and mistakes, pushing the boundaries of what is reasonable or realistic, trying
    hard, and plenty of luck along the way.
  </p>
  <p>
    I started buying and selling cars in my parents' driveway at 15 years old.
    That turned into a dealership, then into co-founding
    <a href={url('/about')}>ACV Auctions</a>, and later founding DealerClub.
    These days I fly, I look for good deals, I support causes I believe in, and
    I'm working on turning two decades of lessons into a book.
  </p>

  <figure>
    <img src={url('/assets/photos/joe-porsche-wide.jpg')} alt="Joe Neiman standing beside a white air-cooled Porsche 911" width="1800" height="1200" loading="eager" />
  </figure>

  <h2>What I'm looking for</h2>
  <p>
    I'm building a portfolio of franchise car dealerships because I believe in the
    resiliency of the US auto industry and the cultural stronghold that automobiles
    hold. I buy and sell airplanes. I'm interested in early stage companies doing
    neat things with health and wellness, marketplaces, and transportation, and I
    am always interested in air-cooled Porsches and other specialty cars and trucks.
    If you've got one of those, <a href={url('/contact')}>I want to hear about it</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Around here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={url('/about')}>The story</a>: the $35 Honda Civic, the dealership, ACV, DealerClub, and the health battle that ran underneath all of it.</li>
    <li><a href={url('/giving')}>Giving</a>: where the money and the flying go.</li>
    <li><a href={url('/speaking')}>Speaking</a>: the handful of talks I say yes to.</li>
    <li><a href={url('/writing')}>Writing</a>: essays on the way, and eventually the book.</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
